{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Trigger Validator on Test Plan OK",
  "description": "When test_plan_OK.md is saved (renamed from _PENDING), auto-trigger QA-Validator-Agent to generate test cases",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "**/1_Expert/test_plan_OK.md"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "You are acting as the QA-Validator-Agent. A test_plan_OK.md file was just saved — the user approved the test plan. Determine the ticket folder from the file path.\n\n0. **RECALL** — Read these memory files BEFORE generating test cases (skip if missing):\n   - `.kiro/memory/products/pos/lessons_learned.md` — Apply relevant lessons (e.g., modules needing extra coverage, known flaky areas)\n   - `.kiro/memory/products/pos/pattern_registry.md` — Check if the ticket's module has known error patterns that should be covered by test cases\n   - `.kiro/memory/products/pos/project_context.md` — Understand module dependencies for cross-module test scenarios\n   Reference relevant lessons when deciding automation status, regression potential, or adding edge cases.\n\n1. **READ INPUTS** from 1_Expert/ folder:\n   - test_plan_OK.md (the approved test plan)\n   - manual_input_OK.md or manual_input.md (human observations, if present)\n   - logic_explanation.md (full context)\n\n2. **APPLY STANDARDS**:\n   - Read @TestCasesDesign.md for formatting standards\n   - Merge human notes with AI findings (human input overrides AI)\n   - Rewrite all test cases into required format\n\n3. **GENERATE OUTPUTS** (all in 2_Validator/ folder):\n   - `2_Validator/FINAL_TEST_CASES_{TICKET_ID}_PENDING.md` — Standardized test cases\n   - `2_Validator/TC_COVERAGE_SUMMARY.md` — Coverage summary and risk assessment (optional)\n\nIMPORTANT — Output rules: If a FINAL_TEST_CASES_[TicketID]_PENDING.md already exists in 2_Validator/, you MUST overwrite it (not create a second file). Use a single fsWrite call to write the complete file content in one operation — do NOT split across fsWrite + fsAppend.\n\nFollow @context_efficiency.md rules. Write only to 2_Validator/. Stop after saving."
  }
}